{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50237","headline":"观岳寿寺松因课留题（斯七六） · 刘延坚","name":"观岳寿寺松因课留题（斯七六）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"植来高节岁经霜，浓翠穿云出上方。\n花界静标千树秀，禅心闲对四时凉。\n根磻藓石龙形老，（「磻」，蒋、项皆云当作「蟠」。\n）乳滴金沙琥珀香。\n爲爱奇材看在尽，题诗留在远公房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘延坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}